# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Name | Provider | Recommended use | Unique benefits | Cost per execution (RUs) |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Tensor-Network Error Mitigation<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/algorithmiq-tem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/algorithmiq-tem/api-reference)<br/>[License](https://ibm.box.com/s/cbvfdhv3i0vnwv4sxkdpp3pcvip27atd)<br/>[EULA](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/blob/main/docs/functions/eula/algorithmiq-tem-eula.pdf)      | Algorithmiq  | Workloads that have low-weight observables and loop-free circuits. | Reduces measurement overhead and variance, outperforming standard error mitigation baselines such as Zero Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) and Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) for relevant circuit classes. | N/A |\n"
"| QESEM: Error Suppression and Error Mitigation<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/qedma-qesem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/qedma-qesem/api-reference)    | Qedma        | Workloads that  include circuits with fractional or parameterized gates, high-weight observables,  and workflows that require unbiased expectation values and accurate runtime estimates. | Produces unbiased expectation values with lower variance and resource overhead, outperforming ZNE and PEC for relevant circuit classes. | N/A |\n"
"| Performance Management<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/q-ctrl-performance-management/api-reference)<br/>[License](https://ibm.box.com/s/ly9cs0lxy6nxqrirt5rt1xisnmvydj9z)<br/>[EULA](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/blob/main/docs/functions/eula/q-ctrl-functions-eula.pdf) | Q-CTRL       | Workloads that contain parametric circuits, deep circuits, or require many circuit executions. | Automatically applies AI-driven error suppression to quantum algorithms, maximizing the performance of IBM devices to deliver accurate results while reducing the number of shots, compute time, and cost required. <br/><br/>Zero-overhead method that improves execution accuracy for the Sampler and the Estimator primitives, compatible with any weight of observables. | S: .5<br/> M: 1<br/>L: 5 |\n"
"| Orbit<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/quantum-elements-orbit)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/quantum-elements-orbit/api-reference) | Quantum Elements | Workloads containing idle periods or scheduling gaps, including static and dynamic circuits such as quantum error correction, mid-circuit measurement, oracular algorithms, variational quantum algorithms, and Hamiltonian simulation. | Combines optimized transpilation, dynamical decoupling, and measurement error mitigation into a unified workflow to improve circuit performance on IBM Quantum hardware. <br/><br/>Applies low-overhead error suppression that preserves the original circuit logic without additional quantum or classical pre-processing time, so that users can enable, disable, or compare each technique against the raw circuit. | S: 0<br/> M: 1<br/>L: 5 |\n"
"| AI-QEM<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/ltm-ai-qem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/ltm-ai-qem/api-reference) | LTM | Estimator workloads, particularly utility-scale circuits with large depth and width, such as Hamiltonian simulation and mirror or Clifford benchmarking circuits. | Uses a graph convolutional network (GCN)-Transformer model, trained on circuit structure, backend topology, Pauli observables, and qubit calibrations, to predict a correction factor for each Pauli term. <br/><br/>Mitigates expectation values with no additional QPU time compared to the Estimator primitive, because the correction is applied during post-processing. | N/A |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama | Provider | Penggunaan yang disarankan | Keunggulan unik | Biaya per eksekusi (RU) |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Tensor-Network Error Mitigation<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/algorithmiq-tem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/algorithmiq-tem/api-reference)<br/>[License](https://ibm.box.com/s/cbvfdhv3i0vnwv4sxkdpp3pcvip27atd)<br/>[EULA](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/blob/main/docs/functions/eula/algorithmiq-tem-eula.pdf)      | Algorithmiq  | Beban kerja dengan observable berbobot rendah dan circuit bebas loop. | Mengurangi overhead pengukuran dan varians, mengungguli baseline mitigasi error standar seperti Zero Noise Extrapolation (ZNE) dan Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) untuk kelas circuit yang relevan. | N/A |\n"
"| QESEM: Error Suppression and Error Mitigation<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/qedma-qesem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/qedma-qesem/api-reference)    | Qedma        | Beban kerja yang mencakup circuit dengan gate fraksional atau berparameter, observable berbobot tinggi, dan alur kerja yang memerlukan nilai ekspektasi tak bias serta estimasi runtime yang akurat. | Menghasilkan nilai ekspektasi tak bias dengan varians dan overhead sumber daya lebih rendah, mengungguli ZNE dan PEC untuk kelas circuit yang relevan. | N/A |\n"
"| Performance Management<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/q-ctrl-performance-management/api-reference)<br/>[License](https://ibm.box.com/s/ly9cs0lxy6nxqrirt5rt1xisnmvydj9z)<br/>[EULA](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/blob/main/docs/functions/eula/q-ctrl-functions-eula.pdf) | Q-CTRL       | Beban kerja yang mengandung circuit parametrik, circuit dalam, atau memerlukan banyak eksekusi circuit. | Secara otomatis menerapkan penekanan error berbasis AI pada algoritma kuantum, memaksimalkan performa perangkat IBM untuk menghasilkan hasil yang akurat sekaligus mengurangi jumlah shot, waktu komputasi, dan biaya. <br/><br/>Metode zero-overhead yang meningkatkan akurasi eksekusi untuk primitif Sampler dan Estimator, kompatibel dengan observable berbobot apa pun. | S: .5<br/> M: 1<br/>L: 5 |\n"
"| Orbit<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/quantum-elements-orbit)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/quantum-elements-orbit/api-reference) | Quantum Elements | Beban kerja yang mengandung periode idle atau celah penjadwalan, termasuk circuit statis dan dinamis seperti koreksi error kuantum, pengukuran di tengah circuit, algoritma oracular, algoritma kuantum variasional, dan simulasi Hamiltonian. | Menggabungkan transpilasi teroptimasi, dynamical decoupling, dan mitigasi error pengukuran dalam satu alur kerja terpadu untuk meningkatkan performa circuit di hardware IBM Quantum. <br/><br/>Menerapkan penekanan error ber-overhead rendah yang mempertahankan logika circuit asli tanpa tambahan waktu pra-pemrosesan kuantum atau klasik, sehingga pengguna bisa mengaktifkan, menonaktifkan, atau membandingkan setiap teknik dengan circuit mentahnya. | S: 0<br/> M: 1<br/>L: 5 |\n"
"| AI-QEM<br/><br/>[Guide](/guides/ltm-ai-qem)<br/>[API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/ltm-ai-qem/api-reference) | LTM | Beban kerja Estimator, terutama circuit skala utilitas dengan depth dan width besar, seperti simulasi Hamiltonian serta circuit benchmarking mirror atau Clifford. | Menggunakan model graph convolutional network (GCN)-Transformer, dilatih pada struktur circuit, topologi backend, observable Pauli, dan kalibrasi qubit, untuk memprediksi faktor koreksi bagi setiap suku Pauli. <br/><br/>Memitigasi nilai ekspektasi tanpa tambahan waktu QPU dibandingkan primitif Estimator, karena koreksi diterapkan saat pasca-pemrosesan. | N/A |\n"

